uys_screenshot4.png", "id": "1799940564131119", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393703_1799940570797785_3585675818044526529_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EqIAhd1L3IkQ7kNvwFY5nGj&_nc_oc=Adp-d-1l0chxzSes68v1muV4Js8dyY3U7mZFPA7fBbxuJUb4-T5OaXvVD6oVDVDQw6w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8t1clCEGkPFrxKdlcBslX1pSNTzkjW1ho-PhRDloCD7g&oe=6A300C8C"}, {"file_name": "twentyguys_screenshot5.png", "id": "1395524361610653", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391911_1395524364943986_3311960218610784276_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EGzaRULNcBQQ7kNvwGvfbuI&_nc_oc=Adp_c_I0_Oeq91Vq1XCw9ywXgziR_q5F68DkpLfNvkY3NnzEsser4bs8WE0QGYcG2Sk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8yYP6d39soZAhdCNNMKQI7O6WmVr-2cei4IrbNnq9u9A&oe=6A3017AA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "twentyguys_meta_landscape.png", "id": "9180708208673870", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391974_9180708215340536_3763626524122213711_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=80TckRMgMw8Q7kNvwElhgXM&_nc_oc=Adp2_7TowsXkdwk9jcHpZK3jVo6tJmdgC9ctDolUIJrw5J_NDG6zoh78qYW2p7WBUS0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-bBdpqfb6zZ4bQ8asTP_IuUkcywuavezSs0q5GlXjjAw&oe=6A301D55"}, "display_name": "Twenty Guys \u2013 Early Access", "keywords": ["free", "ragdoll", "toy"], "long_description": "# So, you\u2019ve got twenty guys...\n\n\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffc\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffd\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffe\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udfff\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffc\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udfff\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffc\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffd\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffd\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffc\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udfff\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffc\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffc\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\ud83c\udffd\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\u200d\u27a1\ufe0f\n\nOh, and there are also fun tools, like a hammer, cheese-on-a-stick and a glue gun. What could possibly go wrong?\n\n\u200e\n\n# This is what players love about Twenty Guys:\n- \u201cI\u2019ve got twenty guys!\u201d\n- \u201cWhooow, I\u2019ll try to smash them all!\u201d\n- \u201cSo, what if I get them all up here on this thing?\u201d\n- \u201cAh, they are looking at me! Why are they following me?! Hahaha\u201d\n- \u201cOk, so\u2026 bowling ball. Hahahahahahahahaha.\u201d\n- \u201cHaha, the most fun with a hammer. EVER!\u201d\n- \u201cLet\u2019s see\u2026 if I grab this one and\u2026 haha. What? Haha, f**k!\u201d\n\n\u200e\n\nTwenty Guys is in **Early Access**, and **free** to play. Download, enjoy and join the community to give feedback and drop ideas of what to do next with these twenty guys. Their survival is in your hands.\n\nJoin our discord at **reso.ly/TwentyGuys**!\n\n\u200e\n\n\u200e\n\n(This game does NOT include cats, gorillas nor any security.)", "short_description": "So, you\u2019ve got twenty guys..."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.resolutiongames.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.resolutiongames.com/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "Resolution Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.resolutiongames.com/twentyguys", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES